{{!
    @template mod_aibranchedscenario/debriefactions

{{!
    @template mod_aibranchedscenario/metricmark

    The mark that stands for one of the three readings.

    Drawn once here rather than written out in both the top bar and the consequence screen,
    so engagement cannot end up as one shape in the bar and a different one underneath a
    ring. The mark takes its colour from whatever it sits in, which on both screens is the
    band the reading currently falls in.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * isengagement bool Whether this is the engagement reading
    * istrust bool Whether this is the trust reading
    * istension bool Whether this is the tension reading

    Example context (json):
    {
        "isengagement": true,
        "istrust": false,
        "istension": false
    }
}}
{{! Engagement is the room with you - so it is the room. Three figures, the middle one
    forward: a heart-monitor trace used to stand here, which said "vital signs" rather
    than "these people are listening to you". }}
{{#isengagement}}
    <svg class="aibs-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <circle cx="10" cy="6.1" r="2.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <path d="M5.9 16.4a4.1 4.1 0 0 1 8.2 0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <circle cx="3.6" cy="8.2" r="1.9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/>
        <path d="M1 15.4a3.1 3.1 0 0 1 3.1-3.1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <circle cx="16.4" cy="8.2" r="1.9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/>
        <path d="M19 15.4a3.1 3.1 0 0 0-3.1-3.1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>
{{/isengagement}}
{{#istrust}}
    <svg class="aibs-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <path d="M10 2.4 16.4 5v4.6c0 3.4-2.4 6.4-6.4 8-4-1.6-6.4-4.6-6.4-8V5Z" fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        <path d="M7.2 9.9 9.4 12l3.6-4.2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>
{{/istrust}}
{{! Tension is how hot the room is, so it is a thermometer. A lightning bolt stood here,
    which reads as a hazard sign - and a high tension is a reading, not an alarm. }}
{{#istension}}
    <svg class="aibs-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <path d="M11.9 11.6V4.7a1.9 1.9 0 0 0-3.8 0v6.9a3.5 3.5 0 1 0 3.8 0Z" fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        {{! The bulb is filled and the column runs into it. Drawn as outline only, the
            thermometer was a thin ring and a floating stroke, and sat noticeably lighter
            beside the shield and the three figures at the size these are actually used. }}
        <circle cx="10" cy="14.4" r="1.9" fill="currentColor"/>
        <path d="M10 8.5v4.4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"
              stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>
{{/istension}}
